book><name>MURAI, TOSHIMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI, NAOYA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA JIDOSHA KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HYODO YOSHIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAI TOSHIMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI NAOYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HYODO, YOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAI, TOSHIMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI, NAOYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An evaporated fuel processing device of an internal combustion engine, wherein fuel vapor sucked into a canister (22) is purged into a surge tank (13) through a purge control valve (28), a target value of a fuel vapor rate indicating a ratio of a fuel vapor amount contained in purge gas to a fuel injection amount is stored beforehand, and at least one of the purge gas amount and fuel injection amount is controlled so that the fuel vapor rate is equal to the target value.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de traitement de carburant évaporé, d'un moteur à combustion interne, dans lequel la vapeur de carburant aspirée dans un contenant (22) est évacuée dans un vase d'expansion (13) par une soupape de commande de purge (28), une valeur cible d'un taux de vapeur de carburant indiquant le rapport entre la quantité de vapeur de carburant contenue dans le gaz de purge et le volume d'injection de carburant, étant mémorisée à l'avance, et au moins un des volumes de gaz de purge et d'injection de carburant étant régulé de sorte que le taux de vapeur de carburant soit égal à la valeur cible.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>